# Canonical test studio (valid): crates/song_text/src/studio_writer.rs, test `settings_at_their_defaults_are_left_out`.
# Case: defaults written out loud (mezzo_forte 64, 0 octaves, 0 ms); the writer leaves them out. The file with _written in its name is the expected result.
